cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If BioVoid contributes to your work, please cite this software release."
type: software
title: "BioVoid: Local Protein Pocket Analysis Prototype"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  BioVoid is a local computational research prototype for full-atom structure
  preparation and geometry-based protein pocket candidate ranking. Its
  motion-aware analysis is experimental and remains separate from the
  canonical static result.
authors:
  - name: "BioVoid contributors"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SetraTheXX/BioVoid"
keywords:
  - protein structure analysis
  - pocket geometry
  - computational research
